            "title": "Information We Collect",
            "text": "<p>When you visit our website or place an order, we may collect the following information:<br/>Full name</p><ul><li>Billing and shipping address<br/></li><li>Email address<br/></li><li>Phone number<br/></li><li>Order and purchase details<br/></li><li>Payment-related information<br/></li><li>Device and browser information<br/></li><li>IP address<br/></li><li>Website browsing and interaction information<br/></li></ul><p>We only collect information that is reasonably necessary to provide and improve our services.<br/><br/></p>"
