            "title": "How We Use Your Information",
            "text": "<p>Your information may be used to:<br/><br/>Process and deliver your orders<br/></p><ul><li>Confirm and communicate order details<br/></li><li>Provide customer support<br/></li><li>Process payments securely<br/></li><li>Handle returns, exchanges, and refunds<br/></li><li>Improve our website, products, and services<br/></li><li>Send important order and service-related notifications<br/></li><li>Prevent fraudulent or unauthorized transactions<br/>Comply with applicable legal and regulatory requirements<br/><br/></li></ul>"
