          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sharing Your Information",
            "text": "<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p><p>We may share necessary information with trusted service providers who help us operate our business, including:</p><ul><li>Payment processing providers<br/></li><li>Shipping and delivery partners<br/></li><li>Website and hosting service providers<br/></li><li>Customer support services<br/></li><li>Analytics and marketing service providers<br/></li></ul><p>These providers may only use information as necessary to perform the services they provide to us.</p><p>We may also disclose information when required by law, legal proceedings, government authorities, or to protect our rights, customers, and website.</p>"
